<section class="gg-support-human-hero">
  <div class="gg-support-human-bg"></div>

  <div class="gg-container gg-support-human-grid">
    <div class="gg-support-human-copy reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Support Goal Grower</span>

      <h1>Help grow an app that makes progress feel human.</h1>

      <p>
        Goal Grower is being built to turn goals into something visual, caring,
        and easier to return to. Support helps move the app from beta toward launch.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Support the Project</a>
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn-soft">Become a Tester</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-support-orbit reveal">
      <div class="gg-orbit-ring ring-one"></div>
      <div class="gg-orbit-ring ring-two"></div>

      <div class="gg-support-orbit-center">
        <span>Goal Grower</span>
        <strong>Beta</strong>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-orbit-pill pill-one">
        <strong>Testing</strong>
        <span>real feedback</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-orbit-pill pill-two">
        <strong>Design</strong>
        <span>more polish</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-orbit-pill pill-three">
        <strong>Launch</strong>
        <span>app store prep</span>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-orbit-pill pill-four">
        <strong>Features</strong>
        <span>shared gardens</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-letter">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-support-letter-panel reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">A real project</span>

      <h2>This is not a finished company pretending to be perfect.</h2>

      <p>
        Goal Grower is being built step by step. Every tester, supporter, bug report,
        and piece of feedback helps turn it into something better.
      </p>

      <p>
        The goal is not just to launch another productivity app. The goal is to
        build a tool that helps people return to the life they are trying to grow.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-impact-flow">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Where support goes</span>
      <h2>Support turns into real progress.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-impact-flow">
      <div class="gg-impact-line"></div>

      <div class="gg-impact-point reveal">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Better testing</h3>
        <p>Getting Goal Grower onto real devices and finding the rough parts faster.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-impact-point reveal">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Clearer design</h3>
        <p>Making the app feel calmer, more intuitive, and more motivating.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-impact-point reveal">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Launch preparation</h3>
        <p>Creating screenshots, store copy, release materials, and setup requirements.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="gg-impact-point reveal">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Future features</h3>
        <p>Improving shared gardens, reminders, widgets, and long-term goal systems.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-choices-human">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-section-heading reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Choose your role</span>
      <h2>There is more than one way to help.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-role-grid">
      <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-role-card reveal">
        <span>Tester</span>
        <h3>Try the app early.</h3>
        <p>Use the beta, notice what feels confusing, and help improve the experience.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-role-card main reveal">
        <span>Supporter</span>
        <h3>Fund the build.</h3>
        <p>Help cover development time, testing, design polish, and launch prep.</p>
      </a>

      <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-role-card reveal">
        <span>Customer</span>
        <h3>Shop the mission.</h3>
        <p>Support through products, digital tools, and future growth resources.</p>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-current-human">
  <div class="gg-container gg-current-human-grid">
    <div class="reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker light">Right now</span>
      <h2>The next version needs real people.</h2>
      <p>
        The app already has goal tracking, garden views, goal details, and shared
        gardens in beta. What it needs next is feedback from people who actually use it.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="gg-current-list reveal">
      <div>
        <strong>What feels motivating?</strong>
        <span>Testing helps reveal what makes users want to return.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>What feels confusing?</strong>
        <span>Feedback helps simplify the app before launch.</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <strong>What should grow next?</strong>
        <span>Support helps prioritize useful future features.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="gg-support-final-human">
  <div class="gg-container">
    <div class="gg-support-final-panel reveal">
      <span class="gg-kicker">Thank you</span>

      <h2>Help build something people can return to.</h2>

      <p>
        If Goal Grower feels like something that should exist, you can help bring it closer
        to release by testing, supporting, or sharing the project.
      </p>

      <div class="gg-hero-actions center">
        <a href="/collections/all" class="gg-btn">Support Now</a>
        <a href="/pages/contact" class="gg-btn-soft">Join Testing</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

